    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at several places in the most part of the island after 1.00 p.m. Fairly heavy falls above 75 mm are likely at some places in Western, Sabaragamuwa, Central, Uva, North-western and North-central provinces and in Galle and Matara districts.",
